WEBVTT

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:12.710
This is...

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:14.240
It can't be!

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.610
Endora?!

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:18.710
Hey! Where the hell did you two come from?!

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:19.450
You!

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:20.720
Ibelda!

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:21.420
Emilio!

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.120
Shun!

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.350
Guidoro! Louise...

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:27.120
Which means, we...

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:29.060
...must have come back to Endora...

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:34.360
It's been so long since we played together, eh?

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.130
I'm so glad to see you're doing well!

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:39.970
That was close!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.110
How come we showed up in front of this guy, of all places?

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:44.570
How am I supposed to know?

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:46.780
Why don't you ask your parinblue thing?

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:47.810
Huh?

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:48.940
What happened?!

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:51.210
Why did you appear from the sky?!

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:54.380
Uh, some stuff happened on the surface...

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.750
Before we knew it, we ended up here.

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:57.750
Surface?

00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:00.120
You two were up on the surface?!

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.490
Hey, you brats!

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:04.090
Don't you forget about me!

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:05.330
Let's talk about it later.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:06.800
Don't have a choice.

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:25.920
<i>In the city without love</i> <i>only your smile remains.</i>

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:35.910
<i>Hold me tight to crush the loneliness,</i> <i>it's all that stops these pains.</i>

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:46.300
<i>You're constrained by that limit.</i>
<i>Free yourself and break apart the chains.</i>

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:56.300
<i>It's all gonna burn on down.</i>
<i>Dance to the flames that consume the night.</i>

00:01:56.480 --> 00:02:06.480
<i>The inferno rages on. It's almost</i> <i>as beautiful as you. Beautiful and bright.</i>

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:17.000
<i>Dance to the end of the night.</i>

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:27.000
<i>The inferno rages on. It's almost</i> <i>as beautiful as you. Beautiful and bright. Dance!</i>

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:37.680
<i>In the city without love</i>

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.270
Your army is nothing.

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.890
I didn't need any help.

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:20.630
This isn't the time to slack off.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:22.120
You don't think I know?

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:32.640
"22: Crisis"

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.710
It's a shame, right?

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:39.110
Huh? What is?

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.750
You were finally able to get to the surface.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:45.050
But now you're stuck back in Endora again.

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:48.750
Heh! I'm more surprised that you actually care!

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.930
I'm not even worried about it.

00:03:55.930 --> 00:04:00.300
With that parinblue inside me,
I can come and go as I please.

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:04.740
That's only if you can figure out how to control it to your will.

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:07.010
Ugh, you've got a point there.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:10.150
I still need to figure out how it works.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:14.120
Hey, hey, hey! It's been so long, why aren't you happy to see me?

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:17.950
Stop yapping with yourselves and come say hello!

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:19.120
Shut up!

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:22.360
We didn't come all this way just to see your face!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:25.430
We're talking about important stuff here!

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:26.600
Shut your mouth!

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.090
Say what?!

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:38.640
Thanks, Junior!

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:39.540
Ibelda!

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:41.780
I'm your opponent, you filthy bastard!

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.510
Stay out of my way!

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:45.950
I don't even care about you!

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:48.280
I'll plow through you!

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.620
Your very existence is a scourge!

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:58.060
The one person who will wipe you from Endora is me!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.500
I don't have time for your blabber!

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.700
My business is with those two brats!

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:06.670
It's them I want!

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:14.310
Guidoro!

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:18.410
This time you're dead for good, Guidoro!

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:22.250
If it's us you want to fight so badly...

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.380
We'll give you all that you asked for!

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:39.430
They did it?

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:46.410
Hmph! You had it coming.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:47.680
Huh? What's the matter?

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:48.910
Something's wrong.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.010
Eh?

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:52.780
H-Hey...

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:55.050
What's going on with him?

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:10.300
What is that?

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:11.730
Ibelda?

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:33.120
Just a little more.

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.650
Just a little more...

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.230
Eljuia?

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:41.800
Don't.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:42.630
But...

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:46.400
Right now, we mustn't disturb his concentration.

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.670
I know, but...

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.940
Ralph is right.

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:53.410
Demetrio.

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:57.410
Eljuia is busy trying to maximize his awareness.

00:06:57.410 --> 00:07:01.820
He's synchronizing his consciousness with Endora as a whole.

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:05.450
But Eljuia hasn't eaten anything this entire time!

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:07.860
I know what he's doing, but at this rate...

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.760
Even I'm worried about him, too.

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:11.990
But, you know...

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.100
Everyone's doing their best.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:18.830
If we hope to save Endora, we all need to do everything we can.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:53.800
Holy smokes! What the hell is he?!

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:55.670
How come he's still moving?!

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:57.210
He should be dead already!

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:59.070
What are you asking me for?

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:01.140
Think of a way we can stop him!

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:02.880
Easier said than done.

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:04.310
He's coming!

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:17.230
Mischa! Felix!

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:19.190
Is that thing Ibelda?

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:21.530
Yeah, but who knows?

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:22.700
Be careful!

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:26.570
He was crazy to begin with, but now he's lost his mind!

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:29.040
There's no knowing what he'll do!

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:30.940
You've gotta be kidding me.

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:40.380
I didn't ask you for help.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:42.550
Don't take it the wrong way.

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:45.540
I'm only thinking about bringing him down.

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.260
Mischa!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.900
Mischa!

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:03.710
Felix!

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:12.370
Felix!

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:14.370
Felix!

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:15.950
Felix!

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:20.820
You monster!

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:37.010
Louise!

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.110
I-I told you!

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:41.180
You...

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.910
...didn't have to...

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.510
I told you, too.

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:48.610
Don't take it... the wrong way...

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:54.960
Guidoro. Where is Aaron?

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:59.190
They had casualties so they retreated to the castle.

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:00.630
I see.

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:05.270
There's nothing we can do to stop him now.

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.000
Let's fall back as well.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.270
Tsk. No other option.

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:25.850
Eljuia sends out his call...

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:32.390
To the deep, unfathomable spirit of Endora...

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.490
If by chance, my prayer is answered...

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:47.300
Please, let your voice be heard...

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:50.470
Let it reach out...

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:02.150
This light is...

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.570
This is...

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:32.590
Eljuia?

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:34.390
A-Alicia!

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:38.790
Eljuia?!

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:42.360
Eljuia!

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:44.070
D-Demetrio?

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:46.400
Are you okay, Eljuia?!

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:48.870
Did you figure anything out?

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:52.570
I was able... to hear.

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:56.750
The voice of Endora... I felt it.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:59.750
The flow of Warp Particles...

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:01.950
The flow of Warp Particles?

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:06.050
All of Endora's particles are...

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:08.420
Tir Na Nog...

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:12.060
Tir Na Nog?

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:16.600
Doctor, how is Eljuia?

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:20.240
His mind and body are severely weakened.

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:23.410
He needs rest more than anything else.

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:26.000
Demetrio? Can I have a word?

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:33.010
Eljuia risked his life to give us this one piece of information.

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:37.590
He told us about the flow of Endora's Warp Particles.

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:38.790
That is...

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:44.260
All of the Warp Particles are gathering at a single point.

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:49.600
Supposing Warp Particles are flowing there, what could be causing it?

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:55.870
If we consider how Endora's
Warp Particles are rapidly diminishing,

00:12:55.870 --> 00:13:00.780
there must be a device there that is extracting them.

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:04.350
However, that area is in the middle of the sea.

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:08.050
How could there possibly be an extraction device there?

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:11.990
Yes. There is nothing shown on the map at all.

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:13.890
However...

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:17.160
It's true that there is something there.

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.730
It must be that...

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:21.330
That? Meaning what?

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:22.730
Tir Na Nog.

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:26.370
Precisely.

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:32.370
There is said to exist the ruins of an ancient civilization.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.640
Tir Na Nog.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:37.710
A heavenly land which is nearly impossible to reach.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:42.480
For ages past, it's very existence was nothing more than a legend.

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:46.420
I thought it was merely a rumor.

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:47.990
Does it really exist?

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:51.260
If there is something hidden in the vastness of the sea...

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.700
...it is most certainly that.

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:57.530
But, we're not entirely sure it exists, are we?

00:13:57.530 --> 00:14:02.100
How do we know Warp Particles are being sucked out of Endora?

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:04.040
There's no use talking about it.

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.370
Let's go find Tir Na Nog.

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:06.710
Yeah, but...

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:08.840
His doubts are understandable.

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:12.610
Whether those ruins exist or not is entirely speculation.

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:15.580
I believe in Eljuia.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:16.920
Demetrio...

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:20.250
You know what? I'd put money on those ruins being real.

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:25.590
Shun!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.060
Emilio!

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:29.460
Thank goodness! Are you all right?

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:30.430
Yeah.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.300
You should worry more about the others.

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:33.730
Hmm?

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:36.570
Felix...

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:37.970
Louise...

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.780
I'm sorry.

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.610
I should have prevented this.

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:47.720
How are they doing?

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:50.550
We were told their lives aren't in danger.

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:51.950
I see...

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.120
And Demetrio?

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:56.490
Hmm. He doesn't show it on his face, but...

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:00.560
I bet he's suffering, too.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.630
You both did well to come back to us.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:04.800
Sorry to worry you.

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:08.500
Sheesh! Where in the world did you two run off to?

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:10.940
You just disappeared without a word!

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:14.240
Well, I guess you could call it a homecoming.

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:17.480
Homecoming? You mean...

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:19.480
Yes, I knew it!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:23.820
You must have gone to the surface.
That's what we figured as well.

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:26.320
Um, sorry for interrupting the conversation, but...

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:28.490
About what you said earlier...

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:30.690
Is it all true then?

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:34.130
Huh? Is what? What did I say?

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:36.630
About the ruins extracting Warp Particles.

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:38.330
Oh, that.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:44.610
I guarantee there's something pulling out the
Warp Particles in that whatever-you-call-it place.

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:46.680
In other words, it's legit.

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:49.810
So Warp Particles are being sent to the surface?

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:52.480
What proof do you have?

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:53.780
Well...

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:55.550
Shun.

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:56.550
I'll tell them.

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.350
No.

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:00.050
I'll say it myself.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:07.330
The one taking Warp Particles from Endora and sending them to the surface...

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.060
...is my father.

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:17.570
Hurry it up!

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:20.710
Ibelda could come attack the castle at any moment!

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:23.010
We have to finish before dawn!

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:26.180
No matter what, we have to protect the castle!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:30.690
It just... surprised me.

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:34.360
Everyone was surprised...
Hearing Shun's story...

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:37.660
That Delzaine is Shun's real father...

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:43.190
And the guy who Shun thought was his father was the person who killed yours.

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:46.090
It's complicated.

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:51.270
You're going tomorrow, right? To Tir Na Nog.

00:16:51.270 --> 00:16:55.280
We have to stop Shun's father from doing as he pleases.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.710
No matter what.

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:00.580
I'm going, too!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.020
Alicia!

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:05.120
Just kidding. You thought I meant it.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.360
I'm joking.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:12.060
I already decided. I'm going to stay here and do everything I can.

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:14.700
Endora's in such a huge predicament now.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:17.370
It kinda makes you think to yourself...

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:21.970
That it's all pointless, no matter what we try to do to help.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:26.040
But inside, I'm sure there's something only I can do.

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:28.480
That's what I believe.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.950
So promise me...

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:33.780
...that you'll come back safe and sound.

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:36.380
I will.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:37.720
You better, okay?

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:38.820
Yeah.

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:40.260
Hey!

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:43.290
We need your help over here!

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:44.730
Okay!

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:57.770
Falarion.

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:12.620
Father...

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:14.320
Shun, Emilio!

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:15.620
We're counting on you.

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:17.290
Leave it to us!

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:19.190
The castle's in your hands now!

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:20.300
Right!

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:22.700
Father, we'll be all right here.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.290
So take care of them!

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.600
Shall we go then?

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:28.640
Yeah.

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:30.260
All aboard!

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:32.670
What the?!

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:33.940
Look at that!

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:35.340
What is it?!

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:48.790
Ibelda!

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:51.330
That's... Ibelda?!

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.900
A shadow of his former self...

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:55.360
Strengthen our defenses!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:57.530
Don't let him get near the castle!

00:18:57.530 --> 00:18:58.200
Joseph!

00:18:58.200 --> 00:18:59.170
Right!

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:02.540
Everyone, just like the plan we went over last night!

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.740
Right! Head into the forest!

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.540
What an ominous sight...

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.310
He's truly a monster now...

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:11.970
That guy got even bigger than he was yesterday.

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:41.940
Good! Now go!

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:45.050
Falarion!

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:50.920
Holy cow!

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:54.950
Yeah. We studied the land and made a trap for him.

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:02.860
Falarion! Are you okay?!

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.700
Hey! This could be bad!

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:05.800
Emilio!

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:07.600
We need to stop Ibelda!

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:15.780
Pascal!

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.910
Pascal!

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:22.920
I'm coming for you!

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:23.950
Don't!

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:24.990
What are you saying?!

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:28.890
You have to go! You have a mission to do!

00:20:30.260 --> 00:20:34.060
I will not let a monster like you get in our way...

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:37.960
Emilio. Shun...

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:41.770
The future of Endora is in your hands...

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.810
This can't be happening...

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:00.420
Pascal!

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:04.890
"To be continued..."

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:13.840
<i>I've walked very far, so far</i>

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:23.340
<i>And I'll walk even farther from here</i>

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:46.130
<i>I don't wish for everything to stay the same</i>

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:56.130
<i>Because change is what got me to where I am</i>

00:21:56.740 --> 00:22:05.320
<i>We've walked very far, so far</i>

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:13.900
<i>We'll go farther than anyone's gone before</i>

00:22:13.900 --> 00:22:22.440
<i>Each of us can change the world</i>

00:22:22.440 --> 00:22:31.610
<i>That's why I smile at you</i>
